type: software
title: "Histopathological AIH prediction with CatBoost"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"
repository-code: "https://github.com/849160181-design/Catboost-model-for-AIH-prediction-from-DILI"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis repository for a two-feature CatBoost model predicting AIH
  from MUM1-positive cells per portal tract and PAS-positive macrophages. The
  repository contains the locked model, the 01_qc to 08_figures analysis pipeline, a
  fully synthetic demonstrator cohort, and a data dictionary. No patient-level data,
  pathology images, medical records, manuscript text, or article-level result tables
  are included. The synthetic cohort is a software-verification fixture, not a clinical
  validation cohort.
keywords:
  - CatBoost
  - AIH
  - autoimmune hepatitis
  - histopathology
  - MUM1
  - PAS macrophages
  - reproducibility
  - synthetic data
